# Build context for the six Containerfiles in this directory, all of which are
# built with `tests/e2e` as their context (see `ensure_images_built` in common.rs).
#
# Without this, that context is 128 MB — `netbox-mock/target`, a host-side build
# directory that is gitignored but that a container build has no reason to know
# is uninteresting. It was tarred and shipped on six of the seven builds every
# run, and `netbox_mock.Containerfile`'s two `COPY netbox-mock .` lines copied it
# *into* the image twice, so a host-side `cargo build` in that crate invalidated
# the mock's layers and forced a rebuild that had nothing to do with its source.
#
# Named `.dockerignore` rather than `.containerignore`: podman reads either
# (preferring `.containerignore`), docker reads only this one, and the harness
# supports both runtimes.
*/target

# The scenario sources and the README live here but are never COPYed by any of
# these Containerfiles — they are the test binary's own source, compiled on the
# host.
*.rs
*.md
